[[eco-bootstrap]]
=== Runtime bootstrap

**STUB**: Specifies what initialization (`morloc init`) produces: the compiled
runtime library, the nexus binary, the per-language bindings and their headers,
and where each is placed. Defines the inputs each artifact depends on and the
conditions that force a rebuild, so a stale runtime is never paired with a
newer compiler. Covers the build modes (release versus development) and what an
installation must provide before any program can be compiled.

